73ebae13a468942ded8b47991b5d56eeeea25c36 (setup/krea2_trainer_setup.py installs that commit). In that checkout:
    git apply ai-toolkit-krea2-lab.patch
It is what the four appliers in setup/ write: [P20-INSTR], [P20-RESUME] (byte-identical resume), [P20-EXIT]
(the process ends before interpreter shutdown), [P20-TECACHE] (the deferred text encoder). Paths read FOUNDRY_ROOT.

